    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage Pinball is a retro pinball game with soothing sounds and attractive graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy the ball movement and the sound of the ball bouncing off the pins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.poster.avif?t=1754622129\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.webm?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.mp4?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the stick in front of you on the right to launch the ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the ball into the hole with the score written on it to earn a score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple stages to play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.poster.avif?t=1754622129\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.webm?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.mp4?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage Pinball is a retro pinball game with soothing sounds and attractive graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy the ball movement and the sound of the ball bouncing off the pins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.poster.avif?t=1754622129\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.webm?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/dc736a0befde039b93336d684631095a.mp4?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the stick in front of you on the right to launch the ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the ball into the hole with the score written on it to earn a score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple stages to play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.poster.avif?t=1754622129\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.webm?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872900/extras/e6e2d68459deb3ebb3200ca2c3000936.mp4?t=1754622129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
